  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forts &#xe5;teruppb SRSA VI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction SRSA VI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatta &#xe5;teruppbyggnadsinsatser i Bosnien-Hercegovina (SRSA VI). Rehabilitering av drygt 475 krigsskadade hus i fem byar i Zvorniks kommun, viss begr&#xe4;nsad lokal infrastruktur samt skolbyggnader. N&#xe4;rmare 1700 personer ber&#xe4;knas kunna flytta tillbaka till sina hem. Svensk samarbetspart &#xe4;r Statens R&#xe4;ddningsverk.St&#xf6;d: 22 000 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will support the Swedish Rescue Services Agency (SRSA) for continuing work with the rehabilitation project for damaged houses in five villages in the Municipality of Zvorniks in Bosnia-Herzegovina, including infrastructure and school buildings. The Sida-support amounts to SEK 22 000 000.</narrative>
  </description>
